      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워!\n덕분에 게시판에 실을 정보가 3개나 생겼어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB355BD84C5D00020AC8CC2DCD310C5D00020C2E4C7440020C815BCF4AC0000200033AC1CB0980020C0DDACBCC5B4002E00100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이게 마지막 질문이야.\n너라면 어떤 내용을 게시판에 싣고 싶니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC8C0020B9C8C9C0B9C90020C9C8BB38C774C57C002E000AB108B77CBA740020C5B4B5A40020B0B4C6A9C7440020AC8CC2DCD310C5D00020C2E3ACE00020C2F6B2C8003F00100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "첫 번째: 반짝반짝 파워",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CCAB0020BC88C9F8003A0020BC18C9DDBC18C9DD0020D30CC6CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "두 번째: 이차원 레벨",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4500020BC88C9F8003A0020C774CC28C6D00020B808BCA80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세 번째: 금색 볼",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C1380020BC88C9F8003A0020AE08C0C90020BCFC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나!\n탁월한 선택이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB0980021000AD0C1C6D4D55C0020C120D0DDC774C57C002E00100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 새로운 게시판을 설치하는 게\n여간 쉬운 일이 아니란 말이지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C0C8B85CC6B40020AC8CC2DCD310C7440020C124CE58D558B2940020AC8C000AC5ECAC040020C26CC6B40020C77CC7740020C544B2C8B7800020B9D0C774C9C0002E00100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시청의 허가도 받아야 하는 데다,\n공사도 발주해야 하고, 얼마나 복잡하다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCCCADC7580020D5C8AC00B3C40020BC1BC544C57C0020D558B2940020B370B2E4002C000AACF5C0ACB3C40020BC1CC8FCD574C57C0020D558ACE0002C0020C5BCB9C8B0980020BCF5C7A1D558B2E4ACE0002E00100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떻게 하실 거예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5BBAC8C0020D558C2E40020AC70C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포기하실 거예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECAE30D558C2E40020AC70C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다 해결할 방법이 있지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E40020D574ACB0D5600020BC29BC95C7740020C788C9C0002100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는야 게시판!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B294C57C0020AC8CC2DCD310002100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나 자신이\n게시판이 되는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0980020C790C2E0C774000AAC8CC2DCD310C7740020B418B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "게시판의 추가 공사가\n시작되기 전까지만 말이지.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아무튼 덕분에 많이 도움이 됐어.\n진심으로 고마워!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC8CC2DCD310C7580020CD94AC000020ACF5C0ACAC00000AC2DCC791B418AE300020C804AE4CC9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C9C0002E00100001BE01000AC544BB34D2BC0020B355BD84C5D00020B9CEC7740020B3C4C6C0C7740020B410C5B4002E000AC9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002100100002011401DC0000",
